    },
    "precision": "Literal analytic proof conditional on the pinned physical ground family/weighted propagation; exact rational native geometry/coefficient/moment arithmetic and explicit kinematic non-native representation discriminators. No numerical actual-ground density or native fullH evolution is claimed. Author delivery awaits parent independent review."
  },
